    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE MINIATURES HAVE GONE MAYHEM!</h2><br>Welcome to Miniature Mayhem! Step into a world where the mad scientist Victor Mayhem seeks giant minions to conquer the world. A rogue gamma ray alters the formula, giving birth to the chaotic Mayhem Miniatures.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545330/extras/ea377ad9cfe3f1727f48019b9d71e17c.poster.avif?t=1734170048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545330/extras/ea377ad9cfe3f1727f48019b9d71e17c.webm?t=1734170048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545330/extras/ea377ad9cfe3f1727f48019b9d71e17c.mp4?t=1734170048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPLIT SCREEN LOCAL MULTIPLAYER</strong></h2><br>Take control of destructive miniature experiments and unleash havoc! Play against up to three friends locally. Engage in Victor's tests, collection, elimination, and occupation in hazardous environments with unique twists. Discover powerful weapons and various power-ups to aid, hinder opponents, or create pure mayhem! Get ready for an action-packed brawl in Miniature Mayhem!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545330/extras/9076d2f8a3e6717642b00f79fd1c7eac.poster.avif?t=1734170048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545330/extras/9076d2f8a3e6717642b00f79fd1c7eac.webm?t=1734170048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545330/extras/9076d2f8a3e6717642b00f79fd1c7eac.mp4?t=1734170048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE MINIATURES HAVE GONE MAYHEM!</h2><br>Welcome to Miniature Mayhem! Step into a world where the mad scientist Victor Mayhem seeks giant minions to conquer the world. A rogue gamma ray alters the formula, giving birth to the chaotic Mayhem Miniatures.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545330/extras/ea377ad9cfe3f1727f48019b9d71e17c.poster.avif?t=1734170048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545330/extras/ea377ad9cfe3f1727f48019b9d71e17c.webm?t=1734170048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545330/extras/ea377ad9cfe3f1727f48019b9d71e17c.mp4?t=1734170048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPLIT SCREEN LOCAL MULTIPLAYER</strong></h2><br>Take control of destructive miniature experiments and unleash havoc! Play against up to three friends locally. Engage in Victor's tests, collection, elimination, and occupation in hazardous environments with unique twists. Discover powerful weapons and various power-ups to aid, hinder opponents, or create pure mayhem! Get ready for an action-packed brawl in Miniature Mayhem!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545330/extras/9076d2f8a3e6717642b00f79fd1c7eac.poster.avif?t=1734170048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545330/extras/9076d2f8a3e6717642b00f79fd1c7eac.webm?t=1734170048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545330/extras/9076d2f8a3e6717642b00f79fd1c7eac.mp4?t=1734170048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
